---
interface Props {
  source: string;
}

const { source } = Astro.props;
const mobileSource = source.split("\n").slice(0, 9).join("\n");
---
<section class="playground-mobile-study" aria-labelledby="playground-mobile-title">
  <header class="playground-section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="hara-v2-kicker">Mobile and touch</p>
      <h2 id="playground-mobile-title">Run first. Edit only when requested.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>The initial Run action keeps the software keyboard closed. Text input focus is granted only by the explicit Edit control.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="playground-mobile-layout">
    <article class="playground-phone" data-mobile-playground data-mobile-state="ready">
      <header class="playground-phone-header">
        <a href="#arrival" aria-label="Back to samples">‹</a>
        <div><strong>Ribbon field</strong><small>interpreter · ready</small></div>
        <button type="button" aria-label="More session options">•••</button>
      </header>
      <div class="playground-phone-meta">
        <span>main.hara</span><code>rev 9f3c2ab7</code><code>gen 4</code>
      </div>
      <div class="playground-phone-editor" data-mobile-editor-shell>
        <textarea data-mobile-editor aria-label="Mobile Hara source" readonly spellcheck="false">{mobileSource}</textarea>
        <span data-mobile-readonly>Read-only until Edit</span>
      </div>
      <div class="playground-phone-transport" role="toolbar" aria-label="Mobile execution controls">
        <button type="button" data-mobile-run><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Run</button>
        <button type="button" data-mobile-cancel disabled><span aria-hidden="true">■</span> Cancel</button>
        <button type="button" data-mobile-edit><span aria-hidden="true">✎</span> Edit</button>
      </div>
      <section class="playground-phone-result" aria-label="Mobile result and diagnostics">
        <header><strong>Result</strong><span data-mobile-runtime-state>Ready</span></header>
        <pre data-mobile-result>{`{:ribbons 12
 :frames 2814
 :status :ready}`}</pre>
        <details>
          <summary>1 diagnostic · inspect without page overflow</summary>
          <p><code>main.hara:18:7</code> Trail width was clamped to the supported preview range.</p>
        </details>
      </section>
      <footer>
        <span><i></i> session pg-7a91</span>
        <span>seq <b data-mobile-sequence>148</b></span>
      </footer>
    </article>

    <div class="playground-mobile-contracts">
      <article>
        <span>Initial action</span>
        <h3>Run does not focus the editor.</h3>
        <p>Execution updates the result and status region while preserving the current viewport and closed keyboard.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Explicit input</span>
        <h3>Edit unlocks and focuses source.</h3>
        <p>The focus transition is intentional, user-triggered, and reversible by leaving edit mode.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Collapse order</span>
        <ol>
          <li>Optional Canvas and 3D controls disappear first.</li>
          <li>Files and Sessions move into a bottom sheet.</li>
          <li>Result follows the editor in document order.</li>
          <li>Diagnostics remain scrollable inside their own region.</li>
        </ol>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Touch contract</span>
        <h3>Transport remains one-thumb operable.</h3>
        <p>Run, Cancel, Edit, and disclosure controls retain at least 44px touch height without forcing horizontal page overflow.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
